<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Nov tax revenue rises 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Argentine Nov tax revenue rises 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine tax revenue rose 4.6 percent in November to $3.71 billion, from last November's $3.55 billion, the Economy Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Total VAT collected reached $1.65 billion, up 7.6 percent on last November's $1.53 billion, said the Ministry.</p>
<p>November income tax collection was $674 million, up 21.7 percent from last year's $554 million.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom + 541 318 0650</p>
</text>
